      "value": "@{65187a0aee0525182341a816|full_name}: looking at the \"ghost\" that looks like they merged accounts, the 97e9 signifies a not full account, steam, vive Oculus. The new name is a proper VRChat account.\n\nThe ghost should disappear, but if it doesn't, merging is an important key word",
