  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I encountered this with a friend I was showing the game yesterday.\n\nShe changed her name while she was running VRC (on PC cause she didn't have a headset). \n\nThe name didn't update immediately, so I told her to log out of both the website and the game, then log back into the game. \n\nWhen she did that, the name was changed, but I now have both names in my friends list. \n\nThe new name seems to work perfectly normal, while the old one is like a ghost, having the avatar picture of the one she was using when she changed the name.",
